    "comments": [
      {
        "id": "comment-1",
        "text": "DELAYS\n\nDelay waits in GAME time without blocking anything: the chain pauses, the game keeps running, and the\nCompleted pin fires after the given milliseconds. Use it for cooldowns, timed spawns and sequences.\nWhile a Delay is counting down it ignores new triggers; Retriggerable Delay restarts instead (not used here).\nBelow, stage goes 1 -> 2 -> 3 with a delay between each step.",
